"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["elserianine"],"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce007_2_04_s_6","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce007_2_04_s_6","text":"– She was reportedly in despair, as her husband—a former commander—remains comatose.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce007_2_04_s_7","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce007_2_04_s_7","text":"– It is believed that she received a Rapture core from an unknown individual, which served as the catalyst for the cult's founding.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["royalmale"],"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce007_2_04_s_8","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce007_2_04_s_8","text":"After establishing the Torch of Salvation, Elseria enticed patients and visitors at the counseling center to join the cult.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["adultman","royalwoman"],"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce007_2_04_s_9","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce007_2_04_s_9","text":"They began holding regular gatherings at a mansion in the Outer Rim.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce007_2_04_s_10","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce007_2_04_s_10","text":"– Some cultists were even sent to the surface and offered as sacrifices to the Raptures.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce007_2_04_s_11","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce007_2_04_s_11","text":"All individuals who went missing in the past two weeks have been linked to the Torch of Salvation.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce007_2_04_s_12","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce007_2_04_s_12","text":"Clothes were found at the entrance of the reformation chamber.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce007_2_04_s_13","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce007_2_04_s_13","text":"The timeline of the disappearances coincides with the D-Wave incident.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce007_2_04_s_14","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce007_2_04_s_14","text":"– The disappearances began after cult members were used as test subjects during the development of the NEO-Virus.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce007_2_04_s_15","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce007_2_04_s_15","text":"The NEO-Virus.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce007_2_04_s_16","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce007_2_04_s_16","text":"Building upon the T-Virus, which hails from another world,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce007_2_04_s_17","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce007_2_04_s_17","text":"it is synthesized by refining a holy elixir extracted from a Rapture's body.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce007_2_04_s_18","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce007_2_04_s_18","text":"This particular Rapture is located at coordinates RAC 10.1.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce007_2_04_s_19","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce007_2_04_s_19","text":"When injected into organic matter, the virus significantly enhances physical and regenerative abilities.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce007_2_04_s_20","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce007_2_04_s_20","text":"However, side effects include bodily deterioration, significant cognitive decline, and increased violent tendencies.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce007_2_04_s_21","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce007_2_04_s_21","text":"Spreading the NEO-Virus within the Ark to incite chaos,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce007_2_04_s_22","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce007_2_04_s_22","text":"and using the resulting confusion to allow the Raptures in, was all part of the Torch of Salvation's plans","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce007_2_04_s_23","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce007_2_04_s_23","text":"– This operation was code-named Project: Reborn Evil.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce007_2_04_s_24","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce007_2_04_s_24","text":"– If the situation is not resolved within two hours,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce007_2_04_s_25","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce007_2_04_s_25","text":"– Blaze Out will initiate a full-scale purge.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce007_2_04_s_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"quiry","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce007_2_04_s_26","text":"Does that about sum it up?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"RuinIndoor","bgArt":"ruinindoor","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["quiry","ce007_03","ce007_02","miranda","poli","d_p","ce007_01"],"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce007_2_04_s_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"quiry","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce007_2_04_s_27","text":"It sounds like we've settled on a plan.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce007_2_04_s_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce007_03","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce007_2_04_s_28","text":"We're here to put a stop to the Project Reborn Evil. Is that it?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce007_2_04_s_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce007_02","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce007_2_04_s_29","text":"When you put it like that, it sounds simple enough.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce007_2_04_s_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"quiry","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce007_2_04_s_30","text":"It sure doesn't feel that way to me...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce007_2_04_s_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce007_03","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce007_2_04_s_31","text":"Still, all we can do is try.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce007_2_04_s_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce007_03","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce007_2_04_s_32","text":"With these many supercops in our midst, I'm sure things will work out somehow.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce007_2_04_s_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"miranda","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce007_2_04_s_33","text":"Yeah! Everything will turn out fine, somehow!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce007_2_04_s_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"miranda","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce007_2_04_s_34","text":"But... who exactly is this supercop you're talking about?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce007_2_04_s_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce007_2_04_s_35","text":"*Sigh*","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce007_2_04_s_36","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce007_2_04_s_36","text":"... I think that's about everything for now.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce007_2_04_s_37","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce007_2_04_s_37","text":"Next, we need to figure out how to stop Project Reborn Evil from taking place.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce007_2_04_s_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"d_p","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce007_2_04_s_38","text":"First, we stop the NEO-Virus from spreading outside the mansion.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce007_2_04_s_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"d_p","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce007_2_04_s_39","text":"Second, we prevent the Raptures from infiltrating the Ark.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce007_2_04_s_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"d_p","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce007_2_04_s_40","text":"These two are what really matters.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce007_2_04_s_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce007_01","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce007_2_04_s_41","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce007_2_04_s_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce007_01","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce007_2_04_s_42","text":"You mentioned earlier that that's the way to the lab?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce007_2_04_s_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce007_03","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce007_2_04_s_43","text":"Yeah. We came down from that side.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce007_2_04_s_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce007_01","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce007_2_04_s_44","text":"Makes sense.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce007_2_04_s_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce007_01","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce007_2_04_s_45","text":"{AccountData.NickName}, if it's all right with you, I'll handle the virus.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce007_2_04_s_46","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce007_2_04_s_46","text":"Huh?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce007_2_04_s_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce007_01","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce007_2_04_s_47","text":"I've got a few ideas in mind.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce007_2_04_s_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce007_01","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce007_2_04_s_48","text":"But it's a plan that requires Agent Winters from the B.S.T.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce007_2_04_s_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce007_01","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce007_2_04_s_49","text":"What do you say, Winters? Want to try your luck with me?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce007_2_04_s_50","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce007_2_04_s_50","text":"D... er, Agent Winters, are you up to it?","jump"